{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこ見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ見てない方がいるかも知れないから\nネタバレにならないように\nまだあんまり言わないでおきますね＼^^／ｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！今日はですね\n収録と撮影とイベの練習\nしてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/11/28/111127_100401.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送も発売も30日も\n待っててね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( ゜_ゝ゜)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなお菓子は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n甘いものが大好きなんで\nチョコ系はめっちゃ好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガルボボールとたけのこの里はやばいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウムは何色がいい？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n乃木坂カラーの紫で！\n中田に全力でケチャお願いします＼^^／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テンション上げるときに何する？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n打つしか～！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちも「こんにち若月」的な\n挨拶みたいなのを探してるんで\nもし良ければ作っていただけると\n嬉しいです＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さような…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}